  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESICOM: Strengthening community resilience of agrosilvopastoral households, incl. internally displaced people, in Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to &#x201c;contribute to the sustainable strengthening of the resilience of agrosilvopastoral households, including those of internally displaced people (IDPs), affected by the security crisis and climate change in the regions of  Boucle du Mouhoun and Nord&#x201d;. 

This objective is broken down into three specific objectives which are (i) Outcome 1: Small producers, including IDPs, improve their resilience to food and nutritional insecurity through strengthening their livelihoods and increasing their production. ; (ii) Outcome 2: Women and young people improve their income through decent rural jobs; (iii) Outcome 3: The populations of the project intervention regions live in an environment of peace and social cohesion thanks to concerted management of shared resources, intra/intercommunity dialogue and the strengthening of local governance.</narrative>
  </description>
